# This is a reference file; the application does NOT automatically load .env.
# Existing risk values below are explicit example overrides, not loader defaults.
# In code: daily_max_loss=0.10, max_position_rate=1.0, cooldown=0.
# No strategy or runtime environment was changed by the documentation audit.
# See docs/ENV_REFERENCE.md. Never commit real credentials.

# PowerShell에서는 아래 이름으로 사용자 환경변수를 설정하세요.
# [Environment]::SetEnvironmentVariable("KIWOOM_APP_KEY", "...", "User")
# [Environment]::SetEnvironmentVariable("KIWOOM_SECRET_KEY", "...", "User")

